🇺🇸🇺🇦 Proxies, Misdirection, and Continuity of Agenda

▪️Western media discusses the possibility of Ukraine's top general being sacked as protests swell following the removal of Ukraine's Minister of Defense;

▪️The war in Ukraine is directed by neither of these men, nor Ukraine's government or military - all of which are tools used by the US in its proxy war on Russia;

▪️These same publications, like the NYT, have admitted the US runs the war from a command center in Germany while Ukraine's military and intelligence agencies have been built from the bottom up as extensions of US military and intelligence capabilities;

▪️This political drama, instead, is meant to manage public perception inside Ukraine and across the West as Ukraine is fully pushed deep inside the woodchipper of proxy war - creating the illusion of responsibility among proxies and harmless pathways for public anger to take that never recognize let alone address the true interests driving the war;
